    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To stream audio chunks from an async source, I need to select a concrete external provider. I will choose AWS Polly, a popular cloud-based text-to-speech service. The code will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with the Polly service. The provider will be identifiable through the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Polly client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789859540708,
          "start": 1789859538554
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf1267a001Kebe5MdaJCvatF",
      "message_id": "msg_0bbf121440014xyKmWtZqLe2fU",
      "session_id": "ses_f440edeccffeWMpuU3RaMFW0Bq",
